        "What would it take to",
        "reach your goal this month?"
      ],
      "audioText": "What would it take to reach your goal this month?",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-67.t02",
      "en": "What is the biggest obstacle for you right now?",
      "es": "¿Cuál es el mayor obstáculo para ti ahora mismo?",
      "explanationEs": "Pregunta abierta con What: no se contesta con sí o no.",
      "segments": [
        "What is the biggest obstacle",
        "for you right now?"
      ],
      "audioText": "What is the biggest obstacle for you right now?",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-67.t03",
      "en": "Which option feels more realistic, and what could you try first?",
      "es": "¿Qué opción te parece más realista y qué podrías probar primero?",
      "explanationEs": "What could you try? invita a pensar en una acción, sin imponer la tuya.",
      "segments": [
        "Which option feels more realistic, and",
        "what could you try first?"
      ],
      "audioText": "Which option feels more realistic, and what could you try first?",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-67.t04",
      "en": "How would you feel if you made progress this week?",
      "es": "¿Cómo te sentirías si progresaras esta semana?",
      "explanationEs": "Pregunta hipotética: would + if + pasado simple.",
      "segments": [
        "How would you feel if",
        "you made progress this week?"
      ],
      "audioText": "How would you feel if you made progress this week?",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n9-leading-coaching-2"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n9.class-67.t05",
      "en": "What would you do if you were more confident?",
      "es": "¿Qué harías si tuvieras más seguridad en ti mismo?",
      "explanationEs": "If + pasado simple (were) para imaginar un escenario.",
